es  she starts stealing the lifespans of the  people around and the surrounding people  comment on how she's a monster who  doesn't look anywhere near death's door  aka she's got a pretty good poker face  law subordinates are freaking out and  say they've gotta get out of here but  law is super cool as usual and says you  guys go ahead kid says the last gasps of  an old wind bag don't scare him and law  activates room while commenting on big  mom's death screeches so the two aren't  frightened and thus big mom cannot  actually take their souls in this manner  it's even pointed out with surprise that  their souls aren't coming out and  they're praised that she's an emperor  and they're not scared at all lying  references corazon when he says i'll  handle this just like the man who saved  my life who of course used his power so  that law's cries wouldn't be heard while  he was escaping kid is just unrelenting  and blunt as usual saying he'll send the  emperor to the afterlife and despite big  mom's talk to kids credit she really  appears to be paralyzed by the canon  attack since she can't move while law is  preparing his own thing with roon law  creates a bubble around big mom and  cancels out every sound she's making  it's funny how law even teases her  pretty much saying oh what's that i  can't hear you  then kid says have another and increases  the power of his continuous attack kind  of like a continued kamehameha and then  like just another push i guess you could  say of it this sends big mom further and  further down into the hole and she has  the so hurt her eyes or whited out thing  going on she wants prometheus and hera  to save her but she can't actually give  orders and say anything eventually she  breaks through to yamato's level and to  yamato's shock because so much damage  made no sound big mom is conscious now  but realizes that nothing she touches  makes a sound she sets off some bombs  but yamato with her ice powers keeps the  damage contained as we knew she would  and the next thing we know big mom is  even more beat up from the explosions  coughing out smoke she's already passed  through the entire floating island  meaning kid in law have done their job  her internal dialogue is interesting as  well she actually calls out roger the  pirate king himself asking why did he  have to go and say all that stuff the  whole world bought it the great pirate  era thing big mom is upset because his  time was up so it didn't affect him but  it does affect her and all those brats  came flooding in looking for their  chance to shine and roger left them  meaning that generation or the uncle to  deal with it while she's thinking this  we also see robin and brooke running  apparently towards zoro's collapsed body  we know zoro is eventually going to be  okay but right now this is insane damage  even for zoro's high pain threshold it  would be funny if the death figure he  saw was just a hallucination combined  with brook's image coming to save him  here but if anyone is close enough to  death right now to actually see death  it's gotta be zorro back to big mom and  she has this interesting camaraderie  with roger like a friend who feels she  was owed more and should have been  treated better she thinks that roger  could have at least told them or their  generation about the one piece before he  croaked and i really loved this feeling  of pirate camaraderie among the legends  and the strongest pirates we also see  rhizo still in the thick of all that  fire and he's the one standing as his  opponent is on the ground saying he  needs water and so rhizo in a very cool  and stoic way came up with the win here  in naruto a ninja is referred to by  kakashi as one who endures so this fight  was pretty much perfect for these two  ninja and ryzel definitely did a great  job at being a ninja aka he did a great  job at enduring big mom is approaching  ground level now in the circular silent  room wondering what is the one piece  where is it does wano hold some of the  answers she's so frustrated by it all  she thinks about kid in-law and how she  won't forgive this she tells them this  won't be enough to kill her and i don't  think anyone really expected them to  kill her just to temporarily beat her or  get her out of the way and she looks  scared as finally another giant  explosion engulfs her we're told in  black and white terms this time no need  to speculate the victors are says the  narrator eustis captain kid and the  surgeon of death trafalgar law the great  thing is too because of the silent room  the giant explosion is not even heard by  the partying capital nearby kit and law  are really drained now and you can see  it it took a lot out of them to smash  big mom like that their side celebrates  saying they defeated big mom this is  huge really huge and i can't agree with  that statement more it's happened we've  defeated ionko and even if big mom  returns to her crew you know the  newspapers will make a big deal of this  defeat and she won't be looked at the  same way again kind of sucks for her  though since she got double teamed and  didn't have the help of her crew here  like kaido did to help her out we then  jump back to yamato who sees momo  through the hole in the basement she  explains one of the bombs went off but  she was able to freeze the others before  the whole armory blew solid job by  yamato here momo then tells her  something else that's huge zunisha is  getting pretty close now yamato responds  you mean the elephant odin mentioned in  his journal and momo says yes exactly it  committed a serious crime 800 years ago  back when it was joyboy's companion and  that's when the chapter ends and we are  told we are going to be on a break next  week more joy boy stuff this arc has  been really amazing for that it was  before suggested by miyagi that zunisha  may not be walking around aimlessly as  it was sentenced to but may actually be  looking for a certain location and now  